，构图采用近景特写，突出人物的神情与环境的苍茫感。\n具体内容：男子留着黑色中长发，发丝凌乱，眼神深邃，直视镜头。他穿着黑色皮夹克，领口敞开，露出颈部。背景为海边的礁石，礁石颜色深灰，表面粗糙，远处是灰蓝色的海面与阴沉的天空，云层厚重，增强了画面的压抑感。\n构图与光线：采用近景特写构图，人物位于画面中心偏右，背景虚化，突出主体。光线来自画面左上方，为自然光，柔和但偏冷，在人物面部与衣物上形成淡淡的阴影，增强了立体感。整体色调以灰、黑、蓝为主，冷峻压抑，营造出孤独沉思的氛围。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 14, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [13], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [1280, 896, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270, 106], "pos": [351.743408203125, 222.29432678222656], "id": 12, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [22], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [330, 100], "pos": [-7.4067606925964355, 761.8779296875], "widgets_values": ["krea2_turbo_fp8.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "剪枝类型"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"weight_dtype": true, "unet_name": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, 